flowchart LR
    Manual[Manual Trigger]
    Schedule[Daily EOD Trigger\n10:00 PM Australia/Brisbane]
    Start[Start Telemetry]
    RunID[Normalize Run ID]
    Summary[Get Operational Control Summary]
    Payload[Build EOD Payload]
    FindToday[Find Today's EOD Row\nalwaysOutputData = true]
    Exists{Today's EOD Exists?\n!!json.id}
    Update[Update Existing EOD Row\nCurrent Authority = true]
    FindCurrent[Find Current Authority EOD Rows]
    ClearPrior[Clear Prior Current Authority\nCurrent Authority = false]
    Create[Create EOD Master Index Record\nCurrent Authority = true]
    Finish[Finish Telemetry Success]
    Error[Finish Telemetry Error]

    Manual --> Start
    Schedule --> Start
    Start --> RunID
    RunID --> Summary
    Summary --> Payload
    Payload --> FindToday
    FindToday --> Exists
    Exists -- true --> Update
    Update --> Finish
    Exists -- false --> FindCurrent
    FindCurrent --> ClearPrior
    ClearPrior --> Create
    Create --> Finish
    Finish -. on error .-> Error
